    "text": "By JR Parachini ,\n15 hours ago UNION COUNTY — A little more than a year ago, David Brearley High School was on a 15-game losing streak, which included a first-time 0-10 season in 2024. The Bears, guided by first-year head coach Elliot Platt last season, were off to an 0-3 start that saw them score only 20 points. Read full article",
